<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77481" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννῠχ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννυχίς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>celebrate a
				night-festival, keep vigil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				17.3
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ θεᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					448
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περὶ τὰ ἀγάλματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timae.
					127
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑορτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.17.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				14.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>do</i> anything <i>the livelong night</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὸξ συνεχὲς π.</span> it <i>lasts all night
				long</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).65
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννυχίζων</span>
			<i>all night long</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				695
			</span></i> (lyr.): c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν νύκτα</span>
			<i>spend the livelong</i> night, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1069
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
